WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:05.430
Intern Scott selected three sets of Scottish&nbsp;
Bagpipes for experimentation with the Clockworks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.270
in an attempt to make a new instrument.&nbsp;
The first set was placed on the setting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:13.410
"1:1," and the output produced was the same&nbsp;
set, colored a different shade of tartan.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:18.150
The second set was placed on the setting "Fine,"&nbsp;
and the output produced was one set of bagpipes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:23.370
that anomalously filled with air despite having&nbsp;
no blowstick. It also lacked a brass drone.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.270
The final set was placed on the setting&nbsp;
"Very Fine." The machine produced a set&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:32.370
of bagpipes that, when held, forced the user&nbsp;
to play Flower of Scotland repeatedly until&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:36.630
either the bagpipes were taken from them by&nbsp;
force, or they collapsed from exhaustion.

